SimplyFlashback inventory compatibility patch

Original plugin: SimplyFlashback 0.1.1 by SimplyRan (simplyran)
https://modrinth.com/plugin/simplyflashback
Published license: Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes: normalize Minecraft 26.3 inventory packets to Flashback hotbar updates;
allow full inventory synchronization through the 26.3 capture filter.
The included build tool wraps V26_3Adapter.encodeCapturedPacket, redirects
PacketCapture$1's outer filter and sets a distinct plugin.yml version.
Original authorship, plugin identity and remaining entries are preserved.
This independent patch is not endorsed by the upstream author.
No original plugin binary, Minecraft classes or third-party libraries are included.
